# Interactive Learning Polish

## Replace these files

- `types/interactiveLesson.ts`
- `services/lessonProgressService.ts`
- `services/progressService.ts`
- `components/lesson/CompleteLessonButton.tsx`
- `components/lesson/LessonCompleteModal.tsx`
- `components/lesson-engine/InteractiveLessonEngine.tsx`

## Improvements

- step changes and responses continue to save
- audio voice and speed are saved with a short debounce
- practice and checkpoint accuracy are calculated
- `lessonProgress.status` becomes `completed`
- XP and completion are updated in one Firestore transaction
- duplicate XP is prevented
- completion summary shows XP, accuracy, mastery impact and review date
- achievements remain supported

## Format and build

```powershell
npx prettier --write `
  ".\types\interactiveLesson.ts" `
  ".\services\lessonProgressService.ts" `
  ".\services\progressService.ts" `
  ".\components\lesson\CompleteLessonButton.tsx" `
  ".\components\lesson\LessonCompleteModal.tsx" `
  ".\components\lesson-engine\InteractiveLessonEngine.tsx"

Remove-Item -Recurse -Force ".next" -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
npm run build
```

## Test

1. Complete guided practice and checkpoint questions.
2. Finish the lesson.
3. Confirm the modal shows accuracy, XP, mastery impact and review date.
4. Confirm Firestore stores:
   - `status: completed`
   - `practiceAccuracy`
   - `checkpointAccuracy`
   - `overallAccuracy`
   - `masteryImpact`
   - `reviewAt`
5. Complete the same lesson again and confirm no additional XP is awarded.
6. Change audio voice and speed, leave the lesson and return.
